  "locales": {
    "csCZ": {
      "dialogue": {
        "fe692cd1fbbfdbd5a065": "Ohlédni se, $r. Úl se probouzí a země kolem nás se chvěje a otřásá.$B$BNastal čas splnit slib, který jsem dal před tisícem let. Písky se znovu přesouvají, zatímco qirajové chystají válku."
      },
      "name": "Baristolth z pohyblivých písků",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
          "dialogue.fe692cd1fbbfdbd5a065": {
            "origin": "ai",
            "source": "ForeverRosettaStoneAI",
            "sourceLocale": "enUS"
          },
          "name": {
            "origin": "ai",
            "source": "ForeverRosettaStoneAI",
            "sourceLocale": "enUS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "daDK": {
      "dialogue": {
        "fe692cd1fbbfdbd5a065": "Se dig tilbage, $r. Kuben vågner, mens landet omkring os bæver og skælver.$B$BTiden er kommet til at indfri et løfte, jeg gav for tusind år siden. Sandet flytter sig atter, mens qirajierne planlægger krig."
      },
      "name": "Baristolth fra det skiftende sand",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
          "dialogue.fe692cd1fbbfdbd5a065": {
            "origin": "ai",
            "source": "ForeverRosettaStoneAI",
            "sourceLocale": "enUS"
          },
          "name": {
            "origin": "ai",
            "source": "ForeverRosettaStoneAI",
            "sourceLocale": "enUS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "deDE": {
      "dialogue": {
        "fe692cd1fbbfdbd5a065": "Seht hinter Euch, $R. Die Schwärme sind in Bewegung und das Land hier zittert und bebt.\n\nEs ist an der Zeit, dass ich mein Versprechen wahrmache, das ich vor tausend Jahren gegeben habe. Mit den Kriegsplänen der Qiraji ziehen auch wieder Sandstürme auf."
      },
      "name": "Baristolth der Sandstürme",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
          "dialogue.fe692cd1fbbfdbd5a065": {
            "origin": "community",
            "source": "Spoken",
            "sourceLocale": "deDE",
            "sourceSha256": "c1cd1597ee8ef61b8859daf63d724a5ec28d311078335b8014ae4d85c11777ac"
          },
          "name": {
            "origin": "community",
            "source": "questie",
            "sourceLocale": "deDE",
            "sourceRevision": "3a621efafce6aef99b0f106d22aa71ca980ee552"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "fe692cd1fbbfdbd5a065": "Look behind you, $r. The hive stirs as the land that surrounds us shudders and shakes.$B$BThe time has come for me to fulfill a promise I made a thousand years past. The sands shift once more as the Qiraji plan for war."
      },
      "name": "Baristolth of the Shifting Sands",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
          "dialogue.fe692cd1fbbfdbd5a065": {
            "origin": "community",
            "source": "Spoken",
            "sourceLocale": "enUS",
            "sourceSha256": "c4e067459948eab40a43d8b6c28acaea77bf01eac085e389dce1fa5d57e9f8fd"
          },
          "name": {
            "origin": "community",
            "source": "questie",
            "sourceLocale": "enUS",
            "sourceRevision": "3a621efafce6aef99b0f106d22aa71ca980ee552"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "esES": {
      "dialogue": {
        "fe692cd1fbbfdbd5a065": "Mira detrás de ti, $r. La colmena se altera a medida que la tierra que nos rodea tiembla y se estremece.\n\nHa llegado la hora de que cumpla una promesa que hice un siglo atrás. Las arenas se mueven de nuevo a medida que los qiraji preparan su plan de guerra."
      },
      "name": "Baristolth del Mar de Dunas",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
          "dialogue.fe692cd1fbbfdbd5a065": {
            "origin": "community",
            "source": "Spoken",
            "sourceLocale": "esES",
